blocks.en:
We evaluate 11 models, grouped into three families by the control information they receive. (a) Camera-conditioned world models. EchoWM ( Zhang et al., 2026 ) , SANA-WM ( Zhu et al., 2026 ) , LingBot-World 2.0 ( Robbyant Team et al., 2026 ) and AlayaWorld v1.1 ( Team et al., 2026 ) receive an RGB first frame, the text prompt, and the recorded camera trajectory. They obtain explicit camera control but no entity trajectories. (b) Proxy-video-to-RGB models. These models translate an engine-rendered control representation into a realistic RGB video. Cosmos-Transfer2.5 ( Ali et al., 2025 ) receives engine depth and class-level segmentation; C2R ( Gomez-Nogales et al., 2026 ) receives the coarse 3D proxy and the text; CWM ( Chen et al., 2026b ) (fine-tuned from MiniMax-H3) receives the CWM proxy, depth, the RGB first frame, and the text;
LynnReal-Omni ( Mao et al., 2026b ) , which builds directly on MiniMax-H3 and extends it with native support for heterogeneous visual controls, including editable 3D renders and game recordings;
and PWM ( Huang et al., 2026a ) receives colored-OBB proxy, the RGB first frame, and the text prompt.
Because PWM is trained only on gunfight scenes, it is evaluated only on the gunfight set of Section 4 . (c) Video foundation models. MiniMax-H3 ( MiniMax-AI, 2026 ) , Seedance 2.5 ( ByteDance Seed Team, 2026 ) are used without any adaptation to our proxy representations. They take the colored-OBB proxy video as a reference video together with the text prompt, and RGB references as specified in each table.

blocks.zh:
我们评估了11种模式,按照它们收到的控制信息分为3个家庭。 (a) 照相机世界模型。 EchoWM (张等, 2026)., SANA-WM (朱等, 2026)., 凌. Bot-World 2.0 (Robbyant Team等,2026年)和AlayaWorld v1.1 (Team等,2026年)获得RGB第一帧,文本快取,并录制相机轨迹. 它们获得明确的相机控制,但没有实体轨迹. (b) 代理视频对RGB模型。 这些模型将一款由引擎驱动的控制代表被转换为现实的RGB视频. Cosmos-Transfer2.5(Ali等,2025年)接收引擎深度和分级;C2R(Gomez-Nogales等,2026年)接收粗重的3D代理和文本;CWM(Chen等,2026年b)(从MiniMax-H3的精细调取)接收CWM代理,深度,RGB第一帧和文本;
LynnReal-Omni(Mao等,2026b.),它直接以MiniMax-H3为基础,在本土支持下扩展它,用于多种视觉控制,包括可编辑的3D制作和游戏录音;
而PWM (Huang et al., 2026a) 则接收有色-OBB代理,RGB第一帧,并被文本提示.
由于PWM只接受枪战场景训练,因此它只接受第4节枪战集的评价. (c) 视频基础模型。 迷你Max-H3(迷你Max-AI,2026),种子 2.5 (字节 (原始内容存档于2026-09-27). Seed Team, 2026) 被使用时没有适应我们的代理陈述. 他们把彩色-OBB代理视频作为参考视频,加上文本提示,以及每个表格所指定的RGB引用.
